What does the ultimate build system look like?

Features

1. Delegated watch mode on every single script.

Without going into the tradeoffs, here's the flow.

1. Create a project at any level in a repo.
1. Project knows what files to watch to rebuild.
1. Project delegates all builds to the daemon, which can do the part efficiently.
